  "_notes": [
    "Compiled by Francis De Brabandere.",
    "Black Knight (Williams 1989)",
    "https://www.ipdb.org/machine.cgi?id=311",
    "Williams System 11B",
    "2025-03 v0.2: Tom Collins added audits",
    "2025-09 v0.4: Tom Collins added to game_state",
    "Adjustments 0x780-0x7E3 are protected by an 8-bit complement sum at 0x7EC: the ROM's checksum",
    "routine (CE 07 80 4F AB 00 08 8C 07 7E4 26 F8 43 39 in U27) sums from 0x780 up to but not including",
    "0x7E4 and complements it, and the ROM stores the result with STAA $07EC. Verified against this",
    "game's saved NVRAM from two cabinets. A write to the block that leaves the check byte stale is",
    "answered at the next boot with a full factory reset of NVRAM (measured live on swrds_l2)."
  ],
